### Start with --spring.profiles.active=case6 (default port 8081).
POST http://localhost:1234/test/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "{{serviceName}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "ratePerSecond": 7,
  "testCount": 800,
  "processingTimeMillis": 3500,
  "onPremises": false
}

### Stop the current test.
POST http://localhost:1234/test/stop/{{serviceName}}
